1
00:00:03,215 --> 00:00:05,135
Open Settings, Audit Trail.

2
00:00:05,135 --> 00:00:09,381
The Events tab lists every event the module can record, each with a

3
00:00:09,381 --> 00:00:11,533
description and an Enabled box.

4
00:00:11,533 --> 00:00:14,325
The Content events are enabled by default.

5
00:00:14,779 --> 00:00:19,689
The Trimming tab sets the Retention period, which is 10 days unless you change it.

6
00:00:19,689 --> 00:00:22,479
A daily task deletes events older than that.

7
00:00:22,934 --> 00:00:26,915
On the Content tab, Allowed content types lists your content types.

8
00:00:26,915 --> 00:00:28,006
Check Article.

9
00:00:28,006 --> 00:00:31,714
Until you check a type, no content events are recorded for it.

10
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:33,049
Click Save.

11
00:00:33,049 --> 00:00:36,200
A message confirms that the site settings were updated.

